{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The lock scripts check only whether a lock exists, so a stale worker can remove or overwrite its replacement’s lock. I’ve restored token comparisons and moved delayed-job promotion after retry ownership validation so a rejected retry cannot emit events or move jobs. The administrative `\"0\"` token bypass remains intact.\n"}}
